\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs16 1r-140v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs16\chcbpat17 Commentary of Rashi}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs16 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 structure:
\par \pard\li1080\fi-360\jclisttab\tx0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\listtext\pard\plain\f2\fs24\lang1033 \'96\tab}\ls8\ilvl1 content:
\plain\par \pard\li720\fi-360\jclisttab\tx0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\listtext\pard\plain\f5\fs24\lang1024 \u-4051 ?\tab}\ls6\ilvl0 \plain \f1\fs16 outline:
\plain\par \pard\li1080\fi-360\jclisttab\tx0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\listtext\pard\plain\f5\fs24\lang1024 \u-4051 ?\tab}\ls6\ilvl1 \plain \f1\fs16 commentary on the Pentateuch: Deuter. 26, 12 until the end (of Deuter.?) with a subscription in the end saying \u8222 \'84I finished (it) \u1500 ?\u1491 ?\u1497 ? \u1502 ?\u1497 ?\u1512 ?\u1510 ?\u1497 ? \u1495 ?\u1494 ?\u1511 ?\ldblquote , maybe (as FD supposes) indicating the 14th of March as the day of completion (fol. 1r \endash  9r)
\plain\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f5\fs24\lang1024 \u-4051 ?\tab}\ls6\ilvl1 \plain \f1\fs16 commentary on the Book of Joshua (complete) with the subscription 
\plain\par \pard\fi0\li1080\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs16 \u8222 \'84\u1505 ?\u1500 ?\u1497 ?\u1511 ? \u1505 ?\u1508 ?\u1512 ? \u1497 ?\u1492 ?\u1493 ?\u1513 ?\u1493 ?\u1506 ?\ldblquote  (i. e. \u8222 \'84end of the Book of Joshua\ldblquote )
\par \pard\li1080\fi-360\jclisttab\tx0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\listtext\pard\plain\f5\fs24\lang1024 \u-4051 ?\tab}\ls6\ilvl1 commentary on the Book of Judges (from the beginning until 5,28)
\plain\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f5\fs24\lang1024 \u-4051 ?\tab}\ls6\ilvl1 \plain \f1\fs16 commentary on the Books of Kings, starting with 1 Kings 7,25 until the end, bearing the subscription: \u1505 ?\u1500 ?\u1497 ?\u1511 ? \u1505 ?\u1508 ?\u1512 ? \u1502 ?\u1500 ?\u1499 ?\u1497 ?\u1501 ? \u1493 ?\u1488 ?\u1514 ?\u1495 ?\u1497 ?\u1500 ? \u1505 ?\u1508 ?\u1512 ? \u1497 ?\u1512 ?\u1502 ?\u1497 ?\u1492 ? \u1492 ?\u1508 ?\u1496 ?\u1512 ?\u1514 ? \u1508 ?\u1504 ?\u1495 ?\u1505 ? \u8222 \'84end of the Book [in Hebrew the term is \u8222 \'84Book\ldblquote , not \u8222 \'84Book\plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs16 s\plain \f1\fs16 \ldblquote !] of Kings and I will start the Book of Jeremiah, Haftarat Pinchas\ldblquote 
\plain\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f5\fs24\lang1024 \u-4051 ?\tab}\ls6\ilvl1 \plain \f1\fs16 Book of Jeremiah until 7,18
\plain\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f5\fs24\lang1024 \u-4051 ?\tab}\ls6\ilvl1 \plain \f1\fs16 Book of Ezekiel from 16,56 until the end
\plain\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f5\fs24\lang1024 \u-4051 ?\tab}\ls6\ilvl1 \plain \f1\fs16 Book of Isaiah (complete) with several annotations by Mar-Josef (\u1504 ?\u1497 ?\u1502 ?\u1493 ?\u1511 ?\u1497 ? \u1502 ?\u1512 ? \u1497 ?\u1493 ?\u1505 ?\u1507 ?); in the end of the appendix there are several additional annotations, marked by  \u8222 \'84\u1502 ?\u1512 ?\u1491 ?\u1499 ?\u1497 ?\ldblquote  (i. e. \u8222 \'84Mordechai\ldblquote ) (fol. 81)
\plain\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f5\fs24\lang1024 \u-4051 ?\tab}\ls6\ilvl1 \plain \f1\fs16 Twelve Minor Prophets (\u8222 \'84Dodekapropheton\ldblquote ): here only the Book of Hosea (1,1 \endash  7,16) is preserved
\plain\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f5\fs24\lang1024 \u-4051 ?\tab}\ls6\ilvl1 \plain \f1\fs16 Book of Psalms: from 55,14 until the end; with the subscription:
\plain\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs16 \u8222 \'84\u1505 ?\u1500 ?\u1497 ?\u1511 ? \u1505 ?\u1508 ?\u1512 ? \u1514 ?\u1500 ?\u1497 ?\u1501 ? \u1513 ?\u1489 ?\u1495 ?\u1493 ?\u1514 ? \u1500 ?\u1491 ?\u1512 ? \u1489 ?\u1512 ?\u1493 ?\u1501 ? \u1494 ?\u1489 ?\u1493 ?\u1500 ?\u1497 ?\u1501 ?\ldblquote 
\par \pard\li1080\fi-360\jclisttab\tx0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\listtext\pard\plain\f5\fs24\lang1024 \u-4051 ?\tab}\ls6\ilvl1 Book of Job; with the addition:
\plain\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs16 \u8222 \'84\u1495 ?\u1505 ?\u1500 ?\u1514 ? \u1505 ?\u1508 ?\u1512 ? \u1488 ?\u1497 ?\u1493 ?\u1489 ? \u1502 ?\u1500 ?\u1508 ?\u1497 ?\u1504 ?\u1493 ? \u1502 ?\u1489 ?\u1492 ?\u1502 ?\u1493 ?\u1514 ? \u1488 ?\u1512 ?\u1509 ? \u1491 ?\u1512 ?\u1513 ?\u1493 ? \u1512 ?\u1489 ?\u1493 ?\u1514 ?\u1497 ?\u1504 ?\u1493 ? \u1502 ?\u1508 ?\u1512 ?\u1491 ?\u1492 ? \u1513 ?\u1499 ?\u1493 ?\u1512 ?\u1506 ?\u1514 ? \u1493 ?\u1502 ?\u1513 ?\u1514 ?\u1504 ?\u1514 ? \u1493 ?\u1502 ?\u1506 ?\u1493 ?\u1507 ? \u1492 ?\u1513 ?\u1502 ?\u1497 ?\u1501 ? \u1497 ?\u1495 ?\u1499 ?\u1502 ?\u1504 ?\u1493 ? \u1494 ?\u1492 ? \u1514 ?\u1512 ?\u1504 ?\u1490 ?\u1493 ?\u1500 ? \u1513 ?\u1502 ?\u1508 ?\u1497 ?\u1497 ?\u1505 ? \u1493 ?\u1488 ?\u1495 ?\u1512 ? \u1499 ?\u1498 ? \u1489 ?\u1493 ?\u1506 ?\u1500 ? \u1489 ?\u1506 ?\u1512 ?\u1493 ?\u1489 ?\u1497 ?\u1503 ?\ldblquote 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0   (Job, 35, 11; cf. h. Erubin, f. 100, b.) \endash  upon this follows the \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs16 preface on the Song of Songs\plain \f1\fs16 ; 
\par \pard\li1080\fi-360\jclisttab\tx0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\listtext\pard\plain\f5\fs24\lang1024 \u-4051 ?\tab}\ls6\ilvl1 Song of Songs and Ecclesiastes (\u8222 \'84with the complete text\ldblquote  \u8594 ? \u8222 \'84integra enarratione illustrata\ldblquote )
\plain\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f5\fs24\lang1024 \u-4051 ?\tab}\ls6\ilvl1 \plain \f1\fs16 Book of Proverbs until 2,15; 
\plain\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f5\fs24\lang1024 \u-4051 ?\tab}\ls6\ilvl1 \plain \f1\fs16 within the books of the prophets the titles of the Haftarot are given
\plain\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs16 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs16 David, Die hebr\u228 \'e4ische Handschriftensammlung, \plain \f1\fs16 , S. 308: \u8222 \'84Raschi-Kommentar zum Pentateuch\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs16 , Haftarot,\plain \f1\fs16  f\u252 \'fcnf Schriftrollen, Hiob, Psalmen und Spr\u252 \'fcche: Die Handschrift stammt aus dem 14. oder 15. Jahrhundert (B.H. 4). Sie weist einige eindrucksvolle Verzierungen auf. Viele Seiten sind verloren gegangen.\ldblquote }

