\pard\fi-360\li1440\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f3\lang1037\fs24 2. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f3\lang1037\fs24\chcbpat17 \u1504 \'f0\u1489 \'e1\u1493 \'e5\u1499 \'eb\u1497 \'e9\u1501 \'ed}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\u8222 \'84F\u252 \'fchrer der Unschl\u252 \'fcssigen\ldblquote ; \u8222 \'84Guide of the Perplexed\ldblquote ; \u8222 \'84Doctor Perplexorum\ldblquote ) by Maimonides (fol. 5-123v), divided into three parts (fol. 5-49r; 49v-88v; 89v-123v) with an epigram before the text starts (given by Delitzsch); inserted into the text are several excerpts from diverse rabbinical text collections (\u8222 \'84Midras Chazit, Midras Qohelet, Pirqe Eliezer, Pesiqta\ldblquote \plain \f4\fs24 ) as well as glosses on the margins; GND (of the Arabic original): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f4\fs24\chcbpat17 Dal\u257 alat al-\u7717 ?\u257 a\u702 ?ir\u299 in, 4256780-4}}\plain \f4\fs24 ; GND (des Autors)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Maimonides, Moses, 118576488}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   }

