\pard\li720\fi-360\jclisttab\tx0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\listtext\pard\plain\f1\fs24\lang1033 -\tab}\ls9\ilvl0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 books:
\plain\par \pard\li1440\fi-360\jclisttab\tx0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\listtext\pard\plain\f1\fs24\lang1033 1.\tab}\ls9\ilvl1 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 five philosophical books, translated by {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Jacob bar-Aba Mare bar-Simson Antolio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f3\fs24 \u1488 ?\u1504 ?\u1496 ?\u1493 ?\u1500 ?\u1497 ?\u1493 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (-> Giacobbe Antoli Napolitano) from Arabic into Hebrew (\u8222 \'84de Arabico hebraice conversi\ldblquote )
\plain\par \pard\fi0\li1440\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 In the colophon of these books Adar II, 1232 (\plain \f3\fs24 \u1514 ?\u1514 ?\u1511 ?\u1510 ?\u1489 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), is given as the date and Naples as the place of completion \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 -> it might be the copy of the original colophon!
\par \pard\fi0\li1440\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [David, Die hebr\u228 \'e4ische Handschriftensammlung, S. 312 writes about it: \u8222 \'84Verschiedene Abhandlungen mittelalterlicher arabischer Philosophie, die in hebr\u228 \'e4ischer \u220 \'dcbersetzung oder durch hebr\u228 \'e4ische Kommentare bekannt sind, wie der Kommentar des Philosophen Averroe [sic!] zu {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Aristoteles}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  oder die philosophischen Werke {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Alghazali}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 s, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[3].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Alfarabis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  und anderer. Die Handschrift (B. H. 11) entstand im 15. Jahrhundert in Spanien oder der Provence.\ldblquote ]
\par \pard\fi0\li1440\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\li720\fi-360\jclisttab\tx0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\listtext\pard\plain\f1\fs24\lang1033 -\tab}\ls1\ilvl0 There are \u8222 \'84tabulae logicarum distributionum (\plain \f2\lang1037\fs24 \u1505 \'f1\u1493 \'e5\u1490 \'e2\u1497 \'e9 \u1492 \'e4\u1502 \'ee\u1497 \'e9\u1504 \'f0\u1497 \'e9\u1501 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\ldblquote  drawn on single pages of the codex.
\plain\par \pard\fi0\li2880\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

