\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 content:
\par \pard\li1080\fi-360\jclisttab\tx0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\listtext\pard\plain\f4\fs24\lang1024 \u-4051 ?\tab}\ls2\ilvl1 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 pentateuch}}\plain \f1\fs24  with haftarot
\plain\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f4\fs24\lang1024 \u-4051 ?\tab}\ls2\ilvl1 \plain \f1\fs24 volumes (\u8222 \'84megillot\ldblquote )
\plain\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f4\fs24\lang1024 \u-4051 ?\tab}\ls2\ilvl1 \plain \f1\fs24 the poetic books Job, Proverbs and Psalms
\plain\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f4\fs24\lang1024 \u-4051 ?\tab}\ls2\ilvl1 \plain \f1\fs24 added in the end:
\plain\par \pard\li1440\fi-360\jclisttab\tx0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\listtext\pard\plain\f4\fs24\lang1024 \u-4051 ?\tab}\ls2\ilvl2 \plain \f1\fs24 Megilta d'Antiochos (\u8222 \'84sermone aramaico\ldblquote ) (fol. 201r-202v)
\plain\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f4\fs24\lang1024 \u-4051 ?\tab}\ls2\ilvl2 \plain \f1\fs24 5 songs (\u8222 \'84cantilena(e) praelusoria(e)\ldblquote , \u8222 \'84Reshujot\ldblquote ) (fol. 203r-203v):
\plain\par \pard\li1800\fi-360\jclisttab\tx0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\listtext\pard\plain\f4\fs24\lang1024 \u-4051 ?\tab}\ls2\ilvl3 \plain \f1\fs24 \u1488 ?\u1512 ?\u1493 ?\u1502 ?\u1501 ? \u1488 ?\u1500 ? \u1504 ?\u1488 ?\u1491 ?\u1512 ?
\plain\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f4\fs24\lang1024 \u-4051 ?\tab}\ls2\ilvl3 \plain \f1\fs24 \u1502 ?\u1512 ?\u1513 ?\u1493 ?\u1514 ? \u1513 ?\u1501 ? \u1492 ?\u1488 ?\u1500 ?
\plain\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f4\fs24\lang1024 \u-4051 ?\tab}\ls2\ilvl3 \plain \f1\fs24 \u1502 ?\u1500 ?\u1498 ? \u1488 ?\u1497 ?\u1503 ? \u1489 ?\u1500 ?\u1514 ?\u1493 ?
\plain\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f4\fs24\lang1024 \u-4051 ?\tab}\ls2\ilvl3 \plain \f1\fs24 \u1497 ?\u1511 ?\u1512 ? \u1492 ?\u1488 ?\u1500 ? \u1488 ?\u1504 ?\u1493 ?\u1489 ?\u1489 ?\u1492 ?
\plain\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f4\fs24\lang1024 \u-4051 ?\tab}\ls2\ilvl3 \plain \f1\fs24 \u1488 ?\u1500 ? \u1504 ?\u1493 ?\u1512 ?\u1488 ? \u1493 ?\u1488 ?\u1497 ?\u1493 ?\u1501 ? \u1497 ?\u1510 ?\u1493 ? \u1506 ?\u1494 ?\u1512 ? \u1500 ?\u1514 ?\u1497 ?\u1493 ?\u1501 ?
\plain\par \pard\li1440\fi-360\jclisttab\tx0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\listtext\pard\plain\f4\fs24\lang1024 \u-4051 ?\tab}\ls2\ilvl2 \plain \f1\fs24 fol. 204r: Eulogies in the end which are used among Jews while reading the sections (parashot) of the Tora (\ldblquote the law\rdblquote ) and the {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Haftara}}\plain \f1\fs24  of the prophets (\u8222 \'84In fol. extremo recens adjecto scriptae sunt eulogiae \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 (\plain \f3\i\lang1049\fs24 \u1042 \'c2\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 erakot)\plain \f1\fs24  in legendis Parasis legis Haphtharisque prophetarum inter Judaeos ubique usitatae.\ldblquote ); title: \ldblquote \u1489 ?\u1512 ?\u1499 ?\u1493 ? \u1488 ?\u1514 ? \u1492 ?\u1502 ?\u1489 ?\u1493 ?\u1512 ?\u1498 ?\rdblquote 
\plain\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 AD, S. 308: \u8222 \'84Pentateuch mit \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Haftarot,\plain \f1\fs24  f\u252 \'fcnf Schriftrollen, Hiob, Psalmen und Spr\u252 \'fcchen: Diese Handschrift stammt aus dem 14. Jahrhundert (B.H. 12).\ldblquote }

