\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (\u8594 ? \u1494 ?\u1512 ?\u1495 ?\u1497 ?\u1492 ? \u1489 ?\u1503 ? \u1497 ?\u1510 ?\u1495 ?\u1511 ? \u1489 ?\u1503 ? \u1513 ?\u1488 ?\u1500 ?\u1514 ?\u1497 ?\u1488 ?\u1500 ? ), hence \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24 R. Zerachia from Barcelona; \plain \f1\fs24 he was a mystical philosopher and one of the most important translators from Arabic to Hebrew];}

