\plain\par \pard\fi0\li1440\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs24 \u1511 ?\u1510 ?\u1493 ?\u1512 ? \u1502 ?\u1488 ?\u1502 ?\u1512 ?\u1497 ? \u1513 ?\u1500 ? \u1502 ?''\u1513 ?\u1492 ?\plain \f3\i\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\fs24  by {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 al-Farabi}}\plain \f1\fs24 , probably from his book \u8222 \'84\u1573 ?\u1581 ?\u1589 ?\u1575 ?\u1569 ? \u1575 ?\u1604 ?\u1593 ?\u1604 ?\u1608 ?\u1605 ?\ldblquote 
