\plain\par \pard\li1440\fi-360\jclisttab\tx0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\listtext\pard\plain\f10\fs24\lang1033 o\tab}\ls1\ilvl1 \plain \f2\fs24 by {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\fs24\chcbpat17 Isaak bar Mordekai ha-Kohen}}\plain \f2\fs24  (scribe), alias known as Lankusch (\u1500 ?\u1504 ?\u1511 ?\u1493 ?\u1513 ?), from Cracow (\u1502 ?\u1511 ?\u1512 ?\u1488 ?\u1511 ?) (cf. colophon fol. 84r)
\plain\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f10\fs24\lang1033 o\tab}\ls1\ilvl1 \plain \f2\fs24 in 1558
\plain\par \pard\li720\fi-360\jclisttab\tx0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\listtext\pard\plain\f7\fs24\lang1033 -\tab}\ls1\ilvl0 \plain \f2\fs24 previous owner: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\fs24\chcbpat17 Matatja de Lakrut [GND: }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f7\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Mattithiah ben Solomon Delacrut; 1089713053; 16th c.}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\fs24\chcbpat17 ]; }}\plain \f2\fs24 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\fs24\chcbpat17 Wagenseil [GND: }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f7\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Wagenseil,\~Johann Christoph; 119090198]}}
\plain\par \pard\fi-360\li720\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 [David, Die hebr\u228 \'e4ische Handschriftensammlung, S. 313: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\fs24\chcbpat17 \u1513 ?\u1506 ?\u1512 ?\u1497 ? \u1488 ?\u1493 ?\u1512 ?\u1492 ?}}\plain \f2\fs24   (\plain \f7\i\lang1033\fs24 Shaa'rei Ora\plain \f2\fs24  (Tore des Lichts) by {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[3].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\fs24\chcbpat17 Joseph ben Avraham Gecatilia}}\plain \f2\fs24 , manuscript made in the 16\plain \f7\super\lang1033\fs24 th\plain \f2\fs24  c.; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\fs24\chcbpat17 \u1502 ?\u1506 ?\u1512 ?\u1499 ?\u1514 ? \u1492 ?\u1488 ?\u1500 ?\u1492 ?\u1493 ?\u1514 ?}}\plain \f2\fs24  by an anonymous author, systematic treatise on early {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\fs24\chcbpat17 Kabbala literature}}\plain \f2\fs24 , manuscript made in the 16\plain \f7\super\lang1033\fs24 th\plain \f2\fs24  c.; \u8222 \'84\plain \f7\i\lang1033\fs24 Ma'arechet ha-Elohut \plain \f2\fs24 (Die Ordnung der G\u246 \'f6ttlichkeit), eine anonyme systematische Abhandlung \u252 \'fcber die fr\u252 \'fche Literatur zur Kabbala (B.H. 15). Das Manuskript stammt aus dem 16. Jahrhundert.\ldblquote ]
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

