\pard\li720\fi-360\jclisttab\tx0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\listtext\pard\plain\f1\fs24\lang1033 \'96\tab}\ls2\ilvl0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\fs24\chcbpat17 \u1502 ?\u1488 ?\u1502 ?\u1512 ? \u1488 ?\u1508 ?\u1513 ?\u1512 ?\u1493 ?\u1514 ? \u1492 ?\u1491 ?\u1489 ?\u1511 ?\u1493 ?\u1514 ? \u1506 ?\u1501 ? \u1492 ?\u1504 ?\u1508 ?\u1512 ?\u1491 ?}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (fol. 1v-21r), philosophical work by {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\fs24\chcbpat17 Averroes}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , translated by {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\fs24\chcbpat17 Mose ben Josua ben Mar David Narbonensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (= Rabbi Moses Narbonensis, v. s.) \u8222 \'84commentatio de possibilitate conjunctionis, qua intellectus agens atque origine aeternus, superstes ille etiam post corporis mortem et a corpore sejunctus (\plain \f2\fs24 \u1492 ?\u1513 ?\u1499 ?\u1500 ? \u1492 ?\u1504 ?\u1489 ?\u1491 ?\u1500 ? \u1492 ?\u1504 ?\u1508 ?\u1512 ?\u1491 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cum intellectu primo s. universali consociatur ac beatitudinem aeternam, h. e. unice veram, nanciscitur [...]\ldblquote  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 (on the possibility of the conjunction of the \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 intellectus agens\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  independent from the body after death with the \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 intellectus primus\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 ); this is an excerpt of Averroes' book {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 \u8222 \'84de intellectu materiali\ldblquote }}
\plain\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\fs24\chcbpat17 \u1502 ?\u1488 ?\u1502 ?\u1512 ? \u1489 ?\u1513 ?\u1499 ?\u1500 ? \u1492 ?\u1497 ?\u1493 ?\u1500 ?\u1488 ?\u1504 ?\u1497 ?}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ); colophon (\u8222 \'84clausula\ldblquote ): completion of the commentary (\plain \f2\fs24 \u1508 ?\u1497 ?\u1512 ?\u1493 ?\u1513 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) on the seventh of Tammuz 5104 (= {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5060[0].5064/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 27.6.1344}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5130[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Perpignan}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f2\fs24 \u1508 ?\u1512 ?\u1508 ?\u1497 ?\u1504 ?\u1497 ?\u1488 ?\u1503 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )}

