\pard\fi0\li720\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\fs24 1r-258v: content:
\par \pard\li720\fi-360\jclisttab\tx0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\listtext\pard\plain\f1\fs24\lang1033 -\tab}\ls1\ilvl0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 inscriptions}}\plain \f2\fs24  from Italy, for the most part belonging to funerals (Latin, Hebrew) (\ldblquote maximam partem sepulcrales\rdblquote )
\plain\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f1\fs24\lang1033 -\tab}\ls1\ilvl0 \plain \f2\fs24 letters from the Netherlands, Germany, Bohemia and Hungary which were sent to Wagenseil (fol. 15 etc. \endash  shattered throughout the codex); languages: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Italian, \plain \f2\fs24 \u8230 \'85
\plain\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f1\fs24\lang1033 -\tab}\ls1\ilvl0 \plain \f2\fs24 odes in praise of certain Christian scholars (\ldblquote in laudem quorundam Literatorum Christianorum\rdblquote );
\plain\par \pard\fi0\li720\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\fs24 a potpourri of Hebrew and Judaeo-German dramas (\ldblquote carminum\rdblquote ), among them:
\par \pard\li1440\fi-360\jclisttab\tx0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\listtext\pard\plain\f1\fs24\lang1033 1.\tab}\ls1\ilvl1 \ldblquote Ein sch\u246 \'f6n neu Purim-Spiel\rdblquote 
\plain\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f1\fs24\lang1033 2.\tab}\ls1\ilvl1 \plain \f2\fs24 \u8230 \'85 [in Rashi script], by an anonymous author
\plain\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f1\fs24\lang1033 3.\tab}\ls1\ilvl1 \plain \f2\fs24 Judaeo-German song, consisting of 23 quatrains (\ldblquote tetrastichis\rdblquote )
\plain\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f1\fs24\lang1033 4.\tab}\ls1\ilvl1 \plain \f2\fs24 \ldblquote Ein deutscher Gesang von wegen ein Theil fromme Leuten\rdblquote , i. e. a version of the song Halel for those who are inexperienced with the Hebrew language
\plain\par \pard\fi0\li720\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\fs24 \par}

