\plain\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f1\fs24\lang1033 \'96\tab}\ls1\ilvl0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 picked out by the Leipzig Senate (\u8222 \'84Senatus Ampliss. Lipsiensis\ldblquote ) in the year 1690 from spoils of war with the Turks (Ottomans), brought from Greece by the (military) camp preacher (\u8222 \'84concionatore castrensi\ldblquote ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 M. Jentsch (no GND-entry found)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; it (the Senate) determined that it had to be stored in the library
