\pard\li1080\fi-360\jclisttab\tx0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\listtext\pard\plain\f1\fs24\lang1033 \'96\tab}\ls1\ilvl1 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f3\lang1037\fs24\chcbpat17 \u1505 \'f1\u1508 \'f4\u1512 \'f8 \u1492 \'e4\u1504 \'f0\u1508 \'f4\u1513 \'f9 \u1513 \'f9\u1500 \'ec \u1488 \'e0\u1512 \'f8\u1505 \'f1\u1496 \'e8\u1493 \'e5}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (fol. 87r-116v), {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Aristotle's}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  three{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  books on the soul}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  with commentary; translated from Arabic by{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Shem Tov ben Isaak}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  von Tortosa [GND: Shem Tov ben Isaak, von Tortosa 101332336X], alias \plain \f3\lang1037\fs24 \u1492 \'e4\u1496 \'e8\u1512 \'f8\u1496 \'e8\u1493 \'e5\u1505 \'f1\u1497 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\u8222 \'84Dertosanus\ldblquote ) who was (cf. Delitzsch) a very famous translator of Arabic books; it is not clear who wrote the commentary; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 title (albeit in another wording) can be found on the lower part of fol. 87r; ending not clearly marked (script not well legible for me)}

