\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs16 1r-171v: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 content:
\par \pard\li720\fi-360\jclisttab\tx0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\listtext\pard\plain\f3\fs24\lang1024 \u-4051 ?\tab}\ls1\ilvl0 \u8222 \'84small book of commandments\ldblquote  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1037\fs24\chcbpat17 \u1505 \'f1\u1508 \'f4\u1512 \'f8 \u1502 \'ee\u1510 \'f6\u1493 \'e5\u1493 \'e5\u1514 \'fa \u1511 \'f7\u1496 \'e8\u1503 \'ef}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) by {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Isaac ben Joseph of Corbeil}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , divided into seven chapters
\plain\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\li720\fi-360\jclisttab\tx0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\listtext\pard\plain\f3\fs24\lang1024 \u-4051 ?\tab}\ls1\ilvl0 added are comments (\plain \f2\lang1037\fs24 \u1492 \'e4\u1490 \'e2\u1492 \'e4\u1493 \'e5\u1514 \'fa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) by {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Perez ben Elias}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  and {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Meir Rothenburgensis (ben Baruk)}}
\plain\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f3\fs24\lang1024 \u-4051 ?\tab}\ls1\ilvl0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 in the margin there are a lot of glosses added everywhere which show excerpts of other ritual books (e. g. \plain \f2\lang1037\fs24 \u1492 \'e4\u1500 \'ec\u1499 \'eb\u1493 \'e5\u1514 \'fa \u1490 \'e2\u1491 \'e3\u1493 \'e5\u1500 \'ec\u1493 \'e5\u1514 \'fa, \u1505 \'f1\u1508 \'f4\u1512 \'f8 \u1502 \'ee\u1510 \'f6\u1493 \'e5\u1493 \'e5\u1514 \'fa \u1490 \'e2\u1491 \'e3\u1493 \'e5\u1500 \'ec, \u1514 \'fa\u1493 \'e5\u1505 \'f1\u1508 \'f4\u1514 \'fa \u1513 \'f9\u1502 \'ee\u1506 \'f2\u1493 \'e5\u1503 \'ef \u1489 \'e1\u1512 \'f8 \u1510 \'f6\u1491 \'e3\u1493 \'e5\u1511 \'f7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )}

