\par \pard\li720\fi-360\jclisttab\tx0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\listtext\pard\plain\f5\fs24\lang1024 \u-4051 ?\tab}\ls26\ilvl0 junction/collection (\ldblquote compages\rdblquote ) of various books
\plain\par \pard\li1080\fi-360\jclisttab\tx0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\listtext\pard\plain\f2\fs24\lang1033 1.\tab}\ls26\ilvl1 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f4\lang1037\fs24\chcbpat17  \u1495 \'e7\u1494 \'e6\u1493 \'e5\u1511 \'f7 \u1488 \'e0\u1502 \'ee\u1493 \'e5\u1504 \'f0\u1492 \'e4}}\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24  (fol. 3r \endash  87r) by{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Isaac ben Abraham}}\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 , who \endash  when about to die \endash  passed it on to his student {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Josef ben Isaac from Troki/Lithuania}}\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f4\lang1037\fs24 \u1488 \'e0\u1497 \'e9\u1513 \'f9 \u1496 \'e8\u1512 \'f8\u1488 \'e0\u1511 \'f7\u1488 \'e0\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 ) to be finished and edited (from chapter 8 of the second book until the end; added a rhythmical prologue); written in \u8222 \'84Polish script\ldblquote  (\u8222 \'84character scripturae est polonicus\ldblquote ); \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 there is a colophon on fol. 87r indicating the end of the work; another text (whatever it is \endash  addition?) can be found on fol. 89r-v; fol. 87v, 87a (r+v), 88 (r+v) are empty}

