\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs24 history:
\par \pard\li720\fi-360\jclisttab\tx0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\listtext\pard\plain\f2\fs24\lang1033 -\tab}\ls10\ilvl0 Wolfius [Wolfius = {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Johann Christoph Wolf (GND: 117444790}}\plain \f1\fs24 ); author of the \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Bibliotheca Hebraea\plain \f1\fs24 , Hamburg 1715\endash 33] overlooked this work when buying rabbinic literature from the widow of{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[3].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17  Unger}}\plain \f1\fs24 , the once pastor (, one of the first \ldblquote Herrnlaursch\u252 \'fctzensis\rdblquote  and \ldblquote Ritzenensis\rdblquote  (?))
\plain\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f2\fs24\lang1033 -\tab}\ls10\ilvl0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Gottfried Obst}}\plain \f1\fs24  (Unger\rquote s son in law (\ldblquote gener\rdblquote )) wrote about this book to {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Gottfried Leonhard Baudis}}\plain \f1\fs24  (1683-1739), the director of the {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezsoz[2].4600/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 Leipzig Rathsbibliothek}}\plain \f1\fs24 , concerning the value of the book; the book has indeed great value from a historical perspective since it tells a lot about the life of many scribes
\plain\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f2\fs24\lang1033 -\tab}\ls10\ilvl0 \plain \f1\fs24 from fol. 2r \endash  2v there are Latin notes, on fol. 3r there is a note in Hebrew and Latin, on fol. 3v in Latin again which also exhibits the names of the owners (Christian Gottlieb Unger and Gottfried Obst) and the date 1723}

