\pard\li1080\fi-360\jclisttab\tx0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\listtext\pard\plain\f5\fs24\lang1024 \u-4051 ?\tab}\ls25\ilvl1 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1037\fs24\chcbpat17 \u1513 \'f9\u1506 \'f2\u1512 \'f8\u1497 \'e9 \u1510 \'f6\u1491 \'e3\u1511 \'f7}}\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24  (fol. 94r-121v; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 scribe differs from the one who had written the works before\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 ), kabbalistic book about the 10 Sefirot by Joseph ben Abraham Gribzol (\plain \f1\lang1037\fs24 \u1497 \'e9\u1493 \'e5\u1505 \'f1\u1507 \'f3 \u1490 \'e2\u1512 \'f8\u1497 \'e9\u1489 \'e1\u1510 \'f6\u1493 \'e5\u1500 \'ec \u1489 \'e1\u1503 \'ef \u1489 \'e1\u1499 \'eb\u1493 \'e5\u1512 \'f8 \u1512 \'f8' \u1488 \'e0\u1489 \'e1\u1512 \'f8\u1492 \'e4\u1501 \'ed\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 ) who finished this work on the 19th of Ab 1429 (the copy of whose work was finished on this date? The life dates of Gikatilla would otherwise not fit\u8230 \'85); scribe: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Yehiel ben Asher Kohen (\u8222 \'84Jehiel Aseri Kohen\ldblquote }}\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 (v. colophon fol. 121v)\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 ; Gribzol is sometimes called Karnitol, sometimes Nyctelo \u8594 ? probably it is {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f3\fs24\chcbpat17 Y\u244 ?s\u275 \'e7f Ben-Avr\u257 \'e2h\u257 \'e2m \u486 ?\u238 ?qa\u7789 ?\u238 ?l\u257 \'e2 (GND:  102470227)}}}

