\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 content:
\par \pard\li720\fi-360\jclisttab\tx0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\listtext\pard\plain\f3\fs24\lang1024 \u-4051 ?\tab}\ls2\ilvl0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Comments on parts of the Hebrew Bible}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (probably the author was not able to finish his work \endash  the rest was filled in with Ibn Ezra's commentary which is very different)
\plain\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f3\fs24\lang1024 \u-4051 ?\tab}\ls2\ilvl0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 a title has been added which reads
